{"boek":"filippenzen","inhoudelijke_controle_voltooid":false,"verzen":104,"koppelingen":1459,"verzen_zonder_grondtekst":0,"verzen_zonder_koppelingslaag":0,"fouten":[{"ref":"filippenzen/2/2","type":"grondwoord_zonder_koppeling","index":5,"grondwoord":"το","strongs":"G3588","context":"Zo vervult mijn blijdschap, dat u mag eensgezind zijn, dezelfde liefde hebbende, van één gemoed en van één gevoelen zijnde.","categorie":"aanvulling_bestaande_koppelingen"},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/1","type":"grondwoord_zonder_koppeling","index":12,"grondwoord":"μεν","strongs":"G3303","context":"Verder, mijn broeders, verblijdt u in de Heere. Deze dingen aan u te schrijven, is mij niet verdrietig, en het geeft u zekerheid.","categorie":"aanvulling_bestaande_koppelingen"},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/14","type":"grondwoord_zonder_koppeling","index":3,"grondwoord":"μεν","strongs":"G3303","context":"Maar één ding doe ik, vergetende, wat achter is, en strekkende mij tot wat voor is, jaag ik naar het doel, tot de prijs van de roeping van God, die van boven is in Christus Jezus.","categorie":"aanvulling_bestaande_koppelingen"}],"woorden_zonder_link":[{"ref":"filippenzen/1/1","tekst":"Paulus en Timotheüs, dienaren van Jezus Christus, aan al de heiligen in Christus Jezus, die te Filippi zijn, met de opzieners en diakenen:","woorden":[{"woord":"van","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"aan","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"de","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"de","start":113,"eind":115}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/2","tekst":" Genade zij u en vrede van God, onze Vader, en de Heere Jezus Christus.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"de","start":47,"eind":49}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/3","tekst":" Ik dank mijn God, telkens als ik aan U gedenk.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"ik","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"aan","start":34,"eind":37}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/4","tekst":"(Altijd in al mijn gebed voor u allen met blijdschap het gebed doende)","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":53,"eind":56}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/5","tekst":" Over uw gemeenschap aan het Evangelie, van de eerste dag af tot nu toe;","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"de","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"af","start":58,"eind":60},{"woord":"toe","start":68,"eind":71}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/6","tekst":"Vertrouwende ditzelve, dat Hij, Die in u een goed werk begonnen heeft, dat voltooien zal tot op de dag van Jezus Christus;","woorden":[{"woord":"Die","start":32,"eind":35},{"woord":"een","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"heeft","start":64,"eind":69},{"woord":"dat","start":71,"eind":74},{"woord":"zal","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"op","start":93,"eind":95},{"woord":"de","start":96,"eind":98},{"woord":"van","start":103,"eind":106}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/7","tekst":"Zoals het bij mij recht is, dat ik van u allen dit gevoel, omdat ik in mijn hart houde, dat u, zowel in mijn banden, als in mijn verantwoording en bevestiging van het Evangelie, u allen, zeg ik, van mijn genade mee deelachtig bent.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"bij","start":10,"eind":13},{"woord":"dat","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"ik","start":32,"eind":34},{"woord":"mijn","start":71,"eind":75},{"woord":"dat","start":88,"eind":91},{"woord":"in","start":121,"eind":123},{"woord":"mijn","start":124,"eind":128},{"woord":"van","start":159,"eind":162},{"woord":"het","start":163,"eind":166},{"woord":"zeg","start":187,"eind":190},{"woord":"ik","start":191,"eind":193},{"woord":"van","start":195,"eind":198},{"woord":"mee","start":211,"eind":214}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/8","tekst":" Want God is mijn Getuige, hoezeer ik begerig ben naar u allen, met innerlijke bewegingen van Jezus Christus.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":35,"eind":37},{"woord":"naar","start":50,"eind":54},{"woord":"van","start":90,"eind":93}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/9","tekst":"En dit bid ik God, dat uw liefde nog meer en meer overvloedig wordt in erkentenis en alle gevoelen;","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":11,"eind":13},{"woord":"God","start":14,"eind":17}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/10","tekst":"Opdat u beproeft de dingen, die daarvan verschillen, opdat u oprecht bent, en zonder aanstoot te geven, tot de dag van Christus;","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":17,"eind":19},{"woord":"die","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"daarvan","start":32,"eind":39},{"woord":"u","start":59,"eind":60},{"woord":"te","start":94,"eind":96},{"woord":"geven","start":97,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"van","start":115,"eind":118}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/11","tekst":"Vervuld met vruchten van de gerechtigheid, die door Jezus Christus zijn tot heerlijkheid en prijs van God.","woorden":[{"woord":"met","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"van","start":21,"eind":24},{"woord":"de","start":25,"eind":27},{"woord":"zijn","start":67,"eind":71},{"woord":"van","start":98,"eind":101}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/12","tekst":"En ik wil, dat u weet, broeders, dat wat aan mij is gebeurd, meer tot bevordering van het Evangelie gekomen is;","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"dat","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"is","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"gebeurd","start":52,"eind":59},{"woord":"van","start":82,"eind":85},{"woord":"het","start":86,"eind":89}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/13","tekst":"Zo dat mijn banden in Christus openbaar geworden zijn in het hele rechthuis, en aan alle anderen;","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":57,"eind":60}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/14","tekst":" En dat het meerderdeel van de broeders in de Heere, door mijn banden vertrouwen gekregen hebbende, overvloediger het Woord onbevreesd durven spreken.","woorden":[{"woord":"dat","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"het","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"van","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"de","start":28,"eind":30},{"woord":"de","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"door","start":53,"eind":57},{"woord":"gekregen","start":81,"eind":89},{"woord":"hebbende","start":90,"eind":98},{"woord":"het","start":114,"eind":117}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/16","tekst":"Anderen verkondigen wel Christus uit twisting, niet zuiver, menende aan mijn banden verdrukking toe te brengen;","woorden":[{"woord":"aan","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"toe","start":96,"eind":99},{"woord":"te","start":100,"eind":102}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/17","tekst":"Maar deze uit liefde, omdat zij weten, dat ik tot verantwoording van het Evangelie gezet ben.","woorden":[{"woord":"omdat","start":22,"eind":27},{"woord":"zij","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"ik","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"van","start":65,"eind":68},{"woord":"het","start":69,"eind":72}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/18","tekst":" Wat dan? Toch wordt Christus op allerlei wijze, hetzij onder een deksel, hetzij in van de waarheid, verkondigd; en daarin verblijd ik mij, ja, ik zal mij ook verblijden.","woorden":[{"woord":"wordt","start":15,"eind":20},{"woord":"op","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"onder","start":56,"eind":61},{"woord":"een","start":62,"eind":65},{"woord":"in","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"van","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"de","start":88,"eind":90},{"woord":"ik","start":132,"eind":134},{"woord":"mij","start":135,"eind":138},{"woord":"ik","start":144,"eind":146},{"woord":"zal","start":147,"eind":150},{"woord":"mij","start":151,"eind":154}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/19","tekst":" Want ik weet, dat dit mij ter zaligheid strekken zal, door uw gebed en ondersteuning van de Geest van Jezus Christus.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":6,"eind":8},{"woord":"van","start":86,"eind":89},{"woord":"de","start":90,"eind":92},{"woord":"van","start":99,"eind":102}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/20","tekst":"Volgens mijn ernstige verwachting en hoop, dat ik in geen zaak zal beschaamd worden; maar dat in alle vrijmoedigheid, zoals altijd, zo ook nu, Christus zal groot gemaakt worden in mijn lichaam, hetzij door het leven, hetzij door de dood.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":47,"eind":49},{"woord":"zaak","start":58,"eind":62},{"woord":"zal","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"dat","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"zo","start":132,"eind":134},{"woord":"zal","start":152,"eind":155},{"woord":"worden","start":170,"eind":176},{"woord":"het","start":206,"eind":209},{"woord":"de","start":229,"eind":231}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/21","tekst":" Want het leven is mij Christus, en het sterven is mij winst.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"is","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"het","start":36,"eind":39},{"woord":"is","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"mij","start":51,"eind":54}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/22","tekst":"Maar of te leven in het vlees, hetzelfde mij raadzaam zij, en wat ik verkiezen zal, weet ik niet.","woorden":[{"woord":"te","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"het","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"zij","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"ik","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"zal","start":79,"eind":82},{"woord":"ik","start":89,"eind":91}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/23","tekst":"Want ik word van deze twee gedrongen, hebbende begeerte, om ontbonden te worden en met Christus te zijn; want dat is zeer verre het beste.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"word","start":8,"eind":12},{"woord":"te","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"worden","start":73,"eind":79},{"woord":"te","start":96,"eind":98},{"woord":"want","start":105,"eind":109},{"woord":"dat","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"is","start":114,"eind":116},{"woord":"het","start":128,"eind":131}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/24","tekst":"Maar in het vlees te blijven, is noodzakelijker om uwentwil.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"te","start":18,"eind":20},{"woord":"is","start":30,"eind":32}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/25","tekst":"En dit vertrouw en weet ik, dat ik zal blijven, en met u allen zal verblijven tot uw bevordering en blijdschap van het geloof;","woorden":[{"woord":"en","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"ik","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"ik","start":32,"eind":34},{"woord":"zal","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"met","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"zal","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"van","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"het","start":115,"eind":118}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/26","tekst":"Opdat uw roem in Christus Jezus overvloedig zij aan mij, door mijn aanwezigheid opnieuw bij u.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":44,"eind":47}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/27","tekst":"Alleen wandelt waardig het Evangelie van Christus, opdat, hetzij ik kom en u zie, hetzij ik afwezig ben, ik van uw zaken mag horen, dat u staat in één geest, met één gemoed gezamenlijk strijdende door het geloof van het Evangelie;","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":23,"eind":26},{"woord":"van","start":37,"eind":40},{"woord":"ik","start":65,"eind":67},{"woord":"ik","start":89,"eind":91},{"woord":"ik","start":105,"eind":107},{"woord":"mag","start":121,"eind":124},{"woord":"u","start":136,"eind":137},{"woord":"met","start":158,"eind":161},{"woord":"door","start":196,"eind":200},{"woord":"het","start":201,"eind":204},{"woord":"van","start":212,"eind":215},{"woord":"het","start":216,"eind":219}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/28","tekst":"En dat u in geen ding verschrikt wordt van degenen, die tegenstaan; dat hun wel een bewijs is van het verderf, maar u van de zaligheid, en dat van God.","woorden":[{"woord":"dat","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"u","start":7,"eind":8},{"woord":"ding","start":17,"eind":21},{"woord":"wordt","start":33,"eind":38},{"woord":"die","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"een","start":80,"eind":83},{"woord":"van","start":94,"eind":97},{"woord":"het","start":98,"eind":101},{"woord":"van","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"de","start":122,"eind":124}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/29","tekst":"Want u is uit genade gegeven in de zaak van Christus, niet alleen in Hem te geloven, maar ook voor Hem te lijden;","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"uit","start":10,"eind":13},{"woord":"in","start":29,"eind":31},{"woord":"de","start":32,"eind":34},{"woord":"te","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"te","start":103,"eind":105}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/1/30","tekst":"Deze strijd hebbende, die u in mij gezien hebt, en nu in mij hoort.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":26,"eind":27},{"woord":"hebt","start":42,"eind":46}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/1","tekst":"Als er dan enige troost is in Christus, als er enige troost is van de liefde, als er enige gemeenschap is van de Geest, als er enige innerlijke bewegingen en ontfermingen zijn;","woorden":[{"woord":"er","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"is","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"er","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"is","start":60,"eind":62},{"woord":"van","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"de","start":67,"eind":69},{"woord":"er","start":82,"eind":84},{"woord":"is","start":103,"eind":105},{"woord":"van","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"de","start":110,"eind":112},{"woord":"er","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"zijn","start":171,"eind":175}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/2","tekst":"Zo vervult mijn blijdschap, dat u mag eensgezind zijn, dezelfde liefde hebbende, van één gemoed en van één gevoelen zijnde.","woorden":[{"woord":"Zo","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"u","start":32,"eind":33},{"woord":"mag","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"zijn","start":49,"eind":53},{"woord":"van","start":81,"eind":84},{"woord":"één","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"en","start":96,"eind":98},{"woord":"van","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"zijnde","start":116,"eind":122}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/3","tekst":"Doe geen ding door twisting of ijdele eer, maar door nederigheid achte de één de ander uitmuntender dan zichzelf.","woorden":[{"woord":"Doe","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"door","start":48,"eind":52},{"woord":"de","start":71,"eind":73},{"woord":"één","start":74,"eind":77},{"woord":"dan","start":100,"eind":103}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/4","tekst":" Ieder zie niet op het zijne, maar ieder zie ook op wat van de anderen is.","woorden":[{"woord":"op","start":16,"eind":18},{"woord":"zie","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"op","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"wat","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"van","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"is","start":71,"eind":73}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/5","tekst":" Want dat gevoelen zij in u, dat ook in Christus Jezus was;","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":19,"eind":22},{"woord":"was","start":55,"eind":58}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/6","tekst":" Die in de gestalte van God zijnde, geen roof geacht heeft voor God even gelijk te zijn;","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"van","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"heeft","start":53,"eind":58},{"woord":"voor","start":59,"eind":63}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/7","tekst":" Maar heeft Zichzelf vernietigd, de gestalte van een dienaar aangenomen hebbende, en is de mensen gelijk geworden;","woorden":[{"woord":"heeft","start":6,"eind":11},{"woord":"de","start":33,"eind":35},{"woord":"van","start":45,"eind":48},{"woord":"een","start":49,"eind":52},{"woord":"en","start":82,"eind":84},{"woord":"is","start":85,"eind":87},{"woord":"de","start":88,"eind":90}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/8","tekst":" En in gedaante gevonden als een mens, heeft Hij Zichzelf vernederd, gehoorzaam geworden zijnde tot de dood, ja, de dood van het kruis.","woorden":[{"woord":"in","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"een","start":29,"eind":32},{"woord":"heeft","start":39,"eind":44},{"woord":"Hij","start":45,"eind":48},{"woord":"de","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":113,"eind":115},{"woord":"van","start":121,"eind":124},{"woord":"het","start":125,"eind":128}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/9","tekst":" Daarom heeft Hem ook God bovenmate verhoogd, en heeft Hem een Naam gegeven, die boven alle naam is;","woorden":[{"woord":"heeft","start":8,"eind":13},{"woord":"heeft","start":49,"eind":54},{"woord":"een","start":59,"eind":62},{"woord":"die","start":77,"eind":80},{"woord":"is","start":97,"eind":99}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/10","tekst":" Opdat in de Naam van Jezus zich zou buigen alle knie van degenen, die in de hemel, en die op de aarde, en die onder de aarde zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"van","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"zich","start":28,"eind":32},{"woord":"van","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"degenen","start":58,"eind":65},{"woord":"die","start":67,"eind":70},{"woord":"in","start":71,"eind":73},{"woord":"de","start":74,"eind":76},{"woord":"die","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"op","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"de","start":94,"eind":96},{"woord":"die","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"de","start":117,"eind":119},{"woord":"aarde","start":120,"eind":125},{"woord":"zijn","start":126,"eind":130}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/11","tekst":" En alle tong zou belijden, dat Jezus Christus de Heere zij, tot heerlijkheid van God van de Vader.","woorden":[{"woord":"zou","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"de","start":47,"eind":49},{"woord":"zij","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"van","start":78,"eind":81},{"woord":"van","start":86,"eind":89},{"woord":"de","start":90,"eind":92}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/12","tekst":"Zo dan, mijn geliefden, zoals u altijd gehoorzaam geweest bent, niet als in mijn aanwezigheid alleen, maar veelmeer nu in mijn afwezen, werkt uw zaligheid met vrees en beven:","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":30,"eind":31},{"woord":"bent","start":58,"eind":62}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/13","tekst":"Want het is God, Die in u werkt zowel het willen als het werken, naar Zijn welbehagen.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"het","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"het","start":53,"eind":56},{"woord":"Zijn","start":70,"eind":74}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/15","tekst":"Opdat u mag onberispelijk en oprecht zijn, kinderen van God zijnde, onstraffelijk in het midden van een krom en verdraaid geslacht, onder wie u schijnt als lichten in de wereld;","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":6,"eind":7},{"woord":"mag","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"van","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"zijnde","start":60,"eind":66},{"woord":"het","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"van","start":96,"eind":99},{"woord":"een","start":100,"eind":103},{"woord":"u","start":142,"eind":143},{"woord":"de","start":167,"eind":169}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/16","tekst":" Voorhoudende het woord van het leven, mij tot een roem tegen de dag van Christus, dat ik niet tevergeefs heb gelopen, noch tevergeefs gewerkt.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"van","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"het","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"een","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"de","start":62,"eind":64},{"woord":"van","start":69,"eind":72},{"woord":"ik","start":87,"eind":89}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/17","tekst":"Ja, als ik ook tot een drankoffer geofferd word over de offergave en bediening van uw geloof, zo verblijde ik mij, en verblijde mij met u allen.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"tot","start":15,"eind":18},{"woord":"een","start":19,"eind":22},{"woord":"word","start":43,"eind":47},{"woord":"de","start":53,"eind":55},{"woord":"van","start":79,"eind":82},{"woord":"zo","start":94,"eind":96},{"woord":"ik","start":107,"eind":109},{"woord":"mij","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"mij","start":128,"eind":131},{"woord":"met","start":132,"eind":135}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/18","tekst":"En om hetzelfde verblijdt u zich ook, en verblijdt ook u met mij.","woorden":[{"woord":"om","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zich","start":28,"eind":32},{"woord":"ook","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"u","start":55,"eind":56},{"woord":"met","start":57,"eind":60}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/19","tekst":"En ik hoop in de Heere Jezus Timotheüs haast tot u te zenden, opdat ik ook welgemoed mag zijn, als ik uw zaken zal verstaan hebben.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"de","start":14,"eind":16},{"woord":"tot","start":45,"eind":48},{"woord":"te","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"ook","start":71,"eind":74},{"woord":"mag","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"zijn","start":89,"eind":93},{"woord":"als","start":95,"eind":98},{"woord":"ik","start":99,"eind":101},{"woord":"zal","start":111,"eind":114}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/20","tekst":"Want ik heb niemand, die even zo gemoed is, die oprecht voor uw zaken zal zorgen.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"die","start":21,"eind":24},{"woord":"even","start":25,"eind":29},{"woord":"zo","start":30,"eind":32},{"woord":"is","start":40,"eind":42},{"woord":"voor","start":56,"eind":60},{"woord":"zal","start":70,"eind":73}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/21","tekst":" Want zij zoeken allen het hunne, niet wat van Christus Jezus is.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"het","start":23,"eind":26},{"woord":"van","start":43,"eind":46},{"woord":"is","start":62,"eind":64}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/22","tekst":"En u weet zijn beproeving, dat hij, als een kind zijn vader, met mij gediend heeft in het Evangelie.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":3,"eind":4},{"woord":"hij","start":31,"eind":34},{"woord":"een","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"zijn","start":49,"eind":53},{"woord":"heeft","start":77,"eind":82},{"woord":"het","start":86,"eind":89}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/23","tekst":"Ik hoop dan wel deze ogenblikkelijk te zenden, zo snel als ik in mijn zaken zal voorzien hebben;","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"te","start":36,"eind":38},{"woord":"als","start":55,"eind":58},{"woord":"ik","start":59,"eind":61},{"woord":"in","start":62,"eind":64},{"woord":"zal","start":76,"eind":79}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/24","tekst":"Maar ik vertrouw in de Heere, dat ik ook zelf spoedig tot u komen zal.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"de","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"ik","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"tot","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"u","start":58,"eind":59},{"woord":"zal","start":66,"eind":69}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/25","tekst":"Maar ik heb nodig geacht tot u te zenden Epafroditus, mijn broeder, en medearbeider en medestrijder, en uw afgezondene, en dienaar van wat ik nodig heb;","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"heb","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"te","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"van","start":131,"eind":134},{"woord":"wat","start":135,"eind":138},{"woord":"heb","start":148,"eind":151}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/26","tekst":"Omdat hij vurig verlangde naar u allen, en zeer angstig was, omdat u gehoord had, dat hij ziek was.","woorden":[{"woord":"hij","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"naar","start":26,"eind":30},{"woord":"u","start":67,"eind":68},{"woord":"had","start":77,"eind":80},{"woord":"hij","start":86,"eind":89},{"woord":"was","start":95,"eind":98}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/27","tekst":"En hij is ook ziek geweest tot nabij de dood; maar God heeft Zich over hem ontfermd; en niet alleen over hem, maar ook over mij, opdat ik niet verdriet op verdriet zou hebben.","woorden":[{"woord":"hij","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"is","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"tot","start":27,"eind":30},{"woord":"de","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"heeft","start":55,"eind":60},{"woord":"Zich","start":61,"eind":65},{"woord":"over","start":66,"eind":70},{"woord":"over","start":100,"eind":104},{"woord":"over","start":119,"eind":123},{"woord":"ik","start":135,"eind":137},{"woord":"zou","start":164,"eind":167}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/28","tekst":"Zo heb ik dan hem des te sneller gezonden, opdat u, hem ziende, opnieuw u zou verblijden, en ik minder verdriet zou hebben.","woorden":[{"woord":"Zo","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"heb","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"ik","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"des","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"te","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"u","start":49,"eind":50},{"woord":"u","start":72,"eind":73},{"woord":"zou","start":74,"eind":77},{"woord":"en","start":90,"eind":92},{"woord":"verdriet","start":103,"eind":111},{"woord":"zou","start":112,"eind":115}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/29","tekst":"Ontvang hem dan in de Heere, met alle blijdschap, en houdt zulke mensen in ere.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":19,"eind":21},{"woord":"mensen","start":65,"eind":71},{"woord":"in","start":72,"eind":74}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/2/30","tekst":"Want om het werk van Christus was hij tot nabij de dood gekomen, zijn leven niet achtende, opdat hij het tekort van uw bediening aan mij vervullen zou.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"van","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"was","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"hij","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"tot","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"de","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"zijn","start":65,"eind":69},{"woord":"hij","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"het","start":101,"eind":104},{"woord":"van","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"zou","start":147,"eind":150}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/1","tekst":"Verder, mijn broeders, verblijdt u in de Heere. Deze dingen aan u te schrijven, is mij niet verdrietig, en het geeft u zekerheid.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"aan","start":60,"eind":63},{"woord":"te","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"is","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"het","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"geeft","start":111,"eind":116},{"woord":"u","start":117,"eind":118}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/2","tekst":" Zie op de honden, ziet op de kwade arbeiders, ziet op de versnijding.","woorden":[{"woord":"op","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"de","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"op","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"de","start":27,"eind":29},{"woord":"op","start":52,"eind":54},{"woord":"de","start":55,"eind":57}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/3","tekst":" Want wij zijn de besnijding, wij, die God in de Geest dienen, en in Christus Jezus roemen, en niet in het vlees betrouwen.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":15,"eind":17},{"woord":"die","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"in","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"de","start":46,"eind":48},{"woord":"het","start":103,"eind":106}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/4","tekst":" Hoewel ik heb, dat ik ook in het vlees betrouwen mocht; als iemand anders denkt te betrouwen in het vlees, ik nog meer.","woorden":[{"woord":"dat","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"ik","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"het","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"mocht","start":50,"eind":55},{"woord":"te","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"het","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"nog","start":111,"eind":114}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/5","tekst":" Besneden op de achtste dag, uit het geslacht van Israël, van de stam van Benjamin, een Hebreër uit de Hebreën, naar de wet een Farizeër;","woorden":[{"woord":"op","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"de","start":13,"eind":15},{"woord":"het","start":33,"eind":36},{"woord":"van","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"van","start":58,"eind":61},{"woord":"de","start":62,"eind":64},{"woord":"van","start":70,"eind":73},{"woord":"een","start":84,"eind":87},{"woord":"de","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":117,"eind":119},{"woord":"een","start":124,"eind":127}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/6","tekst":" Naar de ijver een vervolger van de Gemeente; naar de rechtvaardigheid, die in de wet is, zijnde onberispelijk.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":6,"eind":8},{"woord":"een","start":15,"eind":18},{"woord":"van","start":29,"eind":32},{"woord":"de","start":33,"eind":35},{"woord":"de","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"de","start":79,"eind":81},{"woord":"is","start":86,"eind":88}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/7","tekst":" Maar wat voor mij winst was, dat heb ik om Christus' wil als schade beschouwd.","woorden":[{"woord":"voor","start":10,"eind":14},{"woord":"heb","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"ik","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"wil","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"als","start":58,"eind":61}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/8","tekst":"Ja, zeker, ik acht ook alle dingen schade te zijn, om de uitnemendheid van de kennis van Christus Jezus, mijn Heere; om Wie ik al die dingen schade gerekend heb, en acht die mest te zijn, opdat ik Christus mag winnen.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":11,"eind":13},{"woord":"de","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"van","start":71,"eind":74},{"woord":"de","start":75,"eind":77},{"woord":"van","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"ik","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"dingen","start":134,"eind":140},{"woord":"heb","start":157,"eind":160},{"woord":"die","start":170,"eind":173},{"woord":"ik","start":194,"eind":196},{"woord":"mag","start":206,"eind":209}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/9","tekst":"En in Hem gevonden word, niet hebbende mijn rechtvaardigheid, die uit de wet is, maar die door het geloof van Christus is, namelijk de rechtvaardigheid, die uit God is door het geloof;","woorden":[{"woord":"word","start":19,"eind":23},{"woord":"de","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"is","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"het","start":95,"eind":98},{"woord":"van","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"is","start":119,"eind":121},{"woord":"namelijk","start":123,"eind":131},{"woord":"de","start":132,"eind":134},{"woord":"die","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"is","start":165,"eind":167},{"woord":"het","start":173,"eind":176}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/10","tekst":" Opdat ik Hem kenne, en de kracht van Zijn opstanding, en de gemeenschap van Zijn lijden, Zijn dood gelijkvormig wordende;","woorden":[{"woord":"Opdat","start":1,"eind":6},{"woord":"ik","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"de","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"van","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"de","start":58,"eind":60},{"woord":"van","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"wordende","start":113,"eind":121}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/11","tekst":" Of ik enigszins mag komen tot de wederopstanding van de doden.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"mag","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"de","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"van","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"de","start":54,"eind":56}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/12","tekst":"Niet dat ik het al gekregen heb, of al volmaakt ben; maar ik jaag er naar, of ik het ook grijpen mocht, waartoe ik van Christus Jezus ook gegrepen ben.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":9,"eind":11},{"woord":"het","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"heb","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"ben","start":48,"eind":51},{"woord":"ik","start":58,"eind":60},{"woord":"er","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"naar","start":69,"eind":73},{"woord":"ik","start":78,"eind":80},{"woord":"het","start":81,"eind":84},{"woord":"mocht","start":97,"eind":102},{"woord":"ik","start":112,"eind":114},{"woord":"ben","start":147,"eind":150}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/13","tekst":"Broeders, ik acht niet, dat ik zelf het gegrepen heb.","woorden":[{"woord":"dat","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"ik","start":28,"eind":30},{"woord":"het","start":36,"eind":39},{"woord":"heb","start":49,"eind":52}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/14","tekst":"Maar één ding doe ik, vergetende, wat achter is, en strekkende mij tot wat voor is, jaag ik naar het doel, tot de prijs van de roeping van God, die van boven is in Christus Jezus.","woorden":[{"woord":"doe","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"ik","start":18,"eind":20},{"woord":"is","start":45,"eind":47},{"woord":"mij","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"tot","start":67,"eind":70},{"woord":"is","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"ik","start":89,"eind":91},{"woord":"het","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"de","start":111,"eind":113},{"woord":"van","start":120,"eind":123},{"woord":"de","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"van","start":135,"eind":138},{"woord":"die","start":144,"eind":147},{"woord":"van","start":148,"eind":151},{"woord":"is","start":158,"eind":160}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/15","tekst":"Zovelen dan als wij volmaakt zijn, laat ons dit gevoelen; en als u iets anders gevoelt, ook dat zal u God openbaren.","woorden":[{"woord":"als","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"wij","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"zijn","start":29,"eind":33},{"woord":"laat","start":35,"eind":39},{"woord":"ons","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"u","start":65,"eind":66},{"woord":"zal","start":96,"eind":99}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/16","tekst":"Maar, daar wij toe gekomen zijn, laat ons daarin naar deze regel wandelen, laat ons hetzelfde gevoelen.","woorden":[{"woord":"wij","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"laat","start":33,"eind":37},{"woord":"ons","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"naar","start":49,"eind":53},{"woord":"deze","start":54,"eind":58},{"woord":"laat","start":75,"eind":79},{"woord":"ons","start":80,"eind":83}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/17","tekst":"Wees mee mijn navolgers, broeders, en merkt op degenen, die zo wandelen, zoals u ons tot een voorbeeld hebt.","woorden":[{"woord":"mee","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"die","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"u","start":79,"eind":80},{"woord":"tot","start":85,"eind":88},{"woord":"een","start":89,"eind":92}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/18","tekst":" Want velen wandelen anders; van wie ik u dikwijls gezegd heb, en nu ook huilend zeg, dat zij vijanden van het kruis van Christus zijn;","woorden":[{"woord":"anders","start":21,"eind":27},{"woord":"van","start":29,"eind":32},{"woord":"ik","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"heb","start":58,"eind":61},{"woord":"dat","start":86,"eind":89},{"woord":"zij","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"van","start":103,"eind":106},{"woord":"het","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"van","start":117,"eind":120},{"woord":"zijn","start":130,"eind":134}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/19","tekst":"Hun einde is het verderf, hun God is de buik, en hun heerlijkheid is in hun schande, die aardse dingen bedenken.","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"het","start":13,"eind":16},{"woord":"is","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"de","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"hun","start":49,"eind":52},{"woord":"is","start":66,"eind":68}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/20","tekst":" Maar onze wandel is in de hemelen, waaruit wij ook de Zaligmaker verwachten, namelijk de Heere Jezus Christus;","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"wij","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"de","start":52,"eind":54},{"woord":"namelijk","start":78,"eind":86},{"woord":"de","start":87,"eind":89}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/3/21","tekst":"Die ons vernederd lichaam veranderen zal, opdat hetzelfde gelijkvormig zou worden aan Zijn heerlijk lichaam, naar de werking, waardoor Hij ook alle dingen aan Zichzelf kan onderwerpen.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":37,"eind":40},{"woord":"aan","start":82,"eind":85},{"woord":"de","start":114,"eind":116},{"woord":"waardoor","start":126,"eind":134},{"woord":"aan","start":155,"eind":158}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/1","tekst":" Zo dan, mijn geliefde en zeer gewenste broeders, mijn blijdschap en kroon, staat zo in de Heere, geliefden!","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":88,"eind":90}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/2","tekst":"Ik vermaan Euodia en ik vermaan Syntyche, dat zij eensgezind zijn in de Heere.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"ik","start":21,"eind":23},{"woord":"dat","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"zij","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"de","start":69,"eind":71}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/3","tekst":"En ik bid u ook, oprechte medestrijder, help deze vrouwen, die samen met mij gestreden hebben voor het evangelie, ook met Clemens en mijn overige medearbeiders, van wie de namen zijn in het boek van het leven.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"samen","start":63,"eind":68},{"woord":"met","start":69,"eind":72},{"woord":"zijn","start":178,"eind":182},{"woord":"het","start":186,"eind":189},{"woord":"van","start":195,"eind":198},{"woord":"het","start":199,"eind":202}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/4","tekst":" Verblijd u in de Heere altijd; opnieuw zeg ik: Verblijd u.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":10,"eind":11},{"woord":"de","start":15,"eind":17},{"woord":"ik","start":44,"eind":46},{"woord":"u","start":57,"eind":58}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/5","tekst":"Uw bescheidenheid zij allen mensen bekend. De Heere is nabij.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"is","start":52,"eind":54}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/6","tekst":" Wees in geen ding bezorgd; maar laat uw begeerten in alles, door bidden en smeken, met dankzegging bekend worden bij God;","woorden":[{"woord":"Wees","start":1,"eind":5},{"woord":"in","start":6,"eind":8},{"woord":"laat","start":33,"eind":37},{"woord":"door","start":61,"eind":65}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/7","tekst":" En de vrede van God, die alle verstand te boven gaat, zal uw harten en uw zinnen bewaren in Christus Jezus.","woorden":[{"woord":"te","start":40,"eind":42},{"woord":"zal","start":55,"eind":58}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/8","tekst":"Verder, broeders, al wat waarachtig is, al wat eerlijk is, al wat rechtvaardig is, al wat rein is, al wat liefelijk is, al wat wel luidt, zo er enige deugd is, en zo er enige lof is, bedenkt het;","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":55,"eind":57},{"woord":"is","start":79,"eind":81},{"woord":"is","start":95,"eind":97},{"woord":"is","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"er","start":141,"eind":143},{"woord":"is","start":156,"eind":158},{"woord":"er","start":166,"eind":168},{"woord":"is","start":179,"eind":181}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/9","tekst":" Wat u ook geleerd, en ontvangen, en gehoord, en in mij gezien hebt, doet dat; en de God van de vrede zal met u zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":5,"eind":6},{"woord":"hebt","start":63,"eind":67},{"woord":"van","start":89,"eind":92},{"woord":"zal","start":102,"eind":105}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/10","tekst":"En ik ben enorm verblijd geweest in de Heere, dat u nu eenmaal opnieuw wakker geworden bent om aan mij te gedenken; waaraan u ook gedacht hebt, maar u hebt de gelegenheid niet gehad.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"ben","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"de","start":36,"eind":38},{"woord":"u","start":50,"eind":51},{"woord":"opnieuw","start":63,"eind":70},{"woord":"bent","start":87,"eind":91},{"woord":"om","start":92,"eind":94},{"woord":"u","start":124,"eind":125},{"woord":"hebt","start":138,"eind":142},{"woord":"u","start":149,"eind":150},{"woord":"hebt","start":151,"eind":155},{"woord":"de","start":156,"eind":158},{"woord":"niet","start":171,"eind":175},{"woord":"gehad","start":176,"eind":181}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/11","tekst":"Niet dat ik dit zeg vanwege gebrek; want ik heb geleerd tevreden te zijn in wat ik ben.","woorden":[{"woord":"dit","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"ik","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"heb","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"ik","start":80,"eind":82}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/12","tekst":"En ik weet vernederd te worden, ik weet ook overvloed te hebben; alleszins en in alles ben ik onderwezen, zowel verzadigd te zijn als honger te lijden, zowel overvloed te hebben als gebrek te lijden.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"te","start":21,"eind":23},{"woord":"worden","start":24,"eind":30},{"woord":"ik","start":32,"eind":34},{"woord":"te","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"hebben","start":57,"eind":63},{"woord":"ben","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"ik","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"te","start":122,"eind":124},{"woord":"zijn","start":125,"eind":129},{"woord":"te","start":141,"eind":143},{"woord":"lijden","start":144,"eind":150},{"woord":"te","start":168,"eind":170},{"woord":"hebben","start":171,"eind":177},{"woord":"te","start":189,"eind":191},{"woord":"lijden","start":192,"eind":198}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/13","tekst":" Ik vermag alle dingen door Christus, die mij kracht geeft.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"die","start":38,"eind":41}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/14","tekst":"Toch hebt u wel gedaan, dat u met mijn verdrukking gemeenschap gehad hebt.","woorden":[{"woord":"hebt","start":5,"eind":9},{"woord":"u","start":10,"eind":11},{"woord":"dat","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"u","start":28,"eind":29},{"woord":"met","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"hebt","start":69,"eind":73}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/15","tekst":" En ook u, Filippensen, weet, dat in het begin van het Evangelie, toen ik van Macedonië vertrokken ben, geen Gemeente mij iets medegedeeld heeft tot rekening van uitgaven en ontvangst, dan u alleen.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":37,"eind":40},{"woord":"van","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"ik","start":71,"eind":73},{"woord":"ben","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"iets","start":122,"eind":126},{"woord":"heeft","start":139,"eind":144},{"woord":"van","start":158,"eind":161}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/16","tekst":"Want ook in Thessalonica hebt u mij eenmaal en andermaal gezonden, tot wat ik nodig had.","woorden":[{"woord":"hebt","start":25,"eind":29},{"woord":"u","start":30,"eind":31},{"woord":"wat","start":71,"eind":74},{"woord":"ik","start":75,"eind":77},{"woord":"had","start":84,"eind":87}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/17","tekst":"Niet dat ik de gave zoek, maar ik zoek de vrucht, die overvloedig is tot uw rekening.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":9,"eind":11},{"woord":"ik","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"is","start":66,"eind":68}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/18","tekst":"Maar ik heb alles ontvangen, en ik heb overvloed; ik ben vervuld geworden, als ik van Epafroditus ontvangen heb, dat van u gezonden was, als een aangename geur, een aangename offergave, voor God welbehaaglijk.","woorden":[{"woord":"ik","start":5,"eind":7},{"woord":"heb","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"ik","start":32,"eind":34},{"woord":"heb","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"ik","start":50,"eind":52},{"woord":"ben","start":53,"eind":56},{"woord":"als","start":75,"eind":78},{"woord":"ik","start":79,"eind":81},{"woord":"heb","start":108,"eind":111},{"woord":"gezonden","start":123,"eind":131},{"woord":"was","start":132,"eind":135},{"woord":"als","start":137,"eind":140},{"woord":"een","start":141,"eind":144},{"woord":"een","start":161,"eind":164}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/19","tekst":"Maar mijn God zal naar Zijn rijkdom vervullen al uw behoefte, in heerlijkheid, door Christus Jezus.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":14,"eind":17}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/20","tekst":"Onze God nu en Vader zij de heerlijkheid in alle eeuwigheid. Amen.","woorden":[{"woord":"zij","start":21,"eind":24}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/21","tekst":"Groet alle heiligen in Christus Jezus; U groeten de broeders, die met mij zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"die","start":62,"eind":65},{"woord":"zijn","start":74,"eind":78}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/22","tekst":"Al de heiligen groeten u, en meest die van het huis van de keizer zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"van","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"zijn","start":66,"eind":70}]},{"ref":"filippenzen/4/23","tekst":" De genade van onze Heere Jezus Christus zij met u allen. Amen.","woorden":[{"woord":"van","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"zij","start":41,"eind":44}]}],"aantal_woorden_zonder_link":643}
